+
+### record `frame`
+
+One rendered frame: the cursor from the panel's top left, the partial tick and the milliseconds since the screen opened.
+
+| Field | Type | |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `mouse-x` | `f32` |  |
+| `mouse-y` | `f32` |  |
+| `partial-tick` | `f32` |  |
+| `time-ms` | `u64` |  |
+
+### enum `mouse-button`
+
+| Case | |
+| --- | --- |
+| `left` |  |
+| `right` |  |
+| `middle` |  |
+
+### record `modifiers`
+
+The modifier keys held.
+
+| Field | Type | |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `shift` | `bool` |  |
+| `ctrl` | `bool` |  |
+| `alt` | `bool` |  |
+
+### record `pointer`
+
+| Field | Type | |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `x` | `f32` |  |
+| `y` | `f32` |  |
+| `button` | `mouse-button` |  |
+| `modifiers` | `modifiers` |  |
+
+### record `drag`
+
+| Field | Type | |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `x` | `f32` |  |
+| `y` | `f32` |  |
+| `button` | `mouse-button` |  |
+| `dx` | `f32` |  |
+| `dy` | `f32` |  |
+
+### record `wheel`
+
+| Field | Type | |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `x` | `f32` |  |
